  "ch2.model.title": "Enter an address and see where it lands",
  "ch2.model.how": "Enter a hexadecimal physical address (up to {abits} bits, which covers {agib} GiB across two channels), then switch the scheme to see which channel, bank and row it lands in. “Group-first” puts the bank group below the column: consecutive cache lines first go round all 8 bank groups. Chapter 6 explains why.",
